# Converge on a copy: no mana was spent to cast a copy (CR 707.10), so its X is zero and the number of colors spent on
# the original is not copied. Together as One is paid with white, black, green, red and two colorless - X is four -
# and Lutri, flashed in over it, copies it, the copy's targets moved to Bot1. The copy resolves first and does
# nothing: Bot1 draws none, takes no damage and gains nothing. Then the original draws Bot2 four, deals Bot2 four and
# gains Bot1 four.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Together as One
Lutri, the Spellchaser
Volcanic Island
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Island.Activate(Ability: {R})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{B}{R}{G}{C}{C}
Bot1.Hand.Together as One.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Lutri, the Spellchaser.Cast
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 11
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Sol Ring; Volcanic Island; Lutri, the Spellchaser
Bot1.Library.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Together as One; Black Lotus
